      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Profiling using the live SDK (not the beta version) in editor shows that the Resync object is experiencing O(n) behaviour when it gets a single element from a Component[] array and Udon checks every object in that array against the component blacklist. Perhaps this logic got more expensive in the new version?\nEdit: Nope, that runs every 3 frames, so it's probably not the root cause. Fixing it anyway though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
