  "details": "In the beta branch of my mahjong world (https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_d9c895a1-b141-47f5-874c-e8c7a0eb43df) I noticed significant hitching occurring about every second (half second?) on the master, on open beta. To repro this, simply join this world in 1036; the hitching will be immediately apparent (it's more obvious in VR).\nHitching also occurs with the current release version of this world (https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_685838b2-dc34-47c7-8adf-92d5016075dc), but is slightly less apparent.\nDue to lack of profiling tools I'm uncertain which UdonBehaviour(s) are causing this particular hitch - my initial suspicion might be StateSync, which performs work every half second. However, this work should be short when nothing is happening. I can't think of anything else that would be operating at this frequency, so I suspect something has changed to make garbage collection more impactful.",
